From: havok2-htwo <havok2-htwo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:46:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/17] fixup port 177472ea: the Metal engine builds
 conversation_tier.cpp too

v0.2.12's Mac engine (metal/CMakeLists.txt) compiles the same src/program/generate.cpp, whose tier setup and restore
are not behind a backend guard, but its host source list has its own copy of the engine's files: without
conversation_tier.cpp the Metal `strata` would not link (ConversationTier, conversation_tier_fingerprint).  Added
beside conversation_file.cpp, as in strata_engine.  The file is host code with POSIX/Windows branches only; the
SYCL port has its own generate.cpp and needs nothing.  Not built here (no Mac).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 metal/CMakeLists.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/metal/CMakeLists.txt b/metal/CMakeLists.txt
index 0caeb338..b165b486 100644
--- a/metal/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/metal/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -99,6 +99,7 @@ set(STRATA_METAL_HOST_SOURCES
   ${S}/core/native_head.cpp ${S}/core/native_dense.cpp ${S}/core/verify.cpp ${S}/core/mtp.cpp
   ${S}/core/conversation_snapshot.cpp ${S}/core/conversation_state.cpp ${S}/core/conversation_memory.cpp
   ${S}/core/peer_experts.cpp ${S}/core/arch_defaults.cpp ${S}/core/vmm.cpp ${S}/core/conversation_file.cpp
+  ${S}/core/conversation_tier.cpp
   ${S}/kernels/ngram.cpp ${S}/ngram/ple_reader.cpp ${S}/platform/direct_file.cpp ${S}/platform/io_priority.cpp
   ${S}/prefill/prefill.cpp
   ${S}/spec/suffix_drafter.cpp ${S}/spec/controller.cpp ${S}/spec/draft_policy.cpp ${S}/spec/draft_source.cpp
